    "name": "Raptor",
    "steam_appid": 3846520,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D dinosaur horror game where you have to collect multiple materials to escape while being chased by a tracker in a laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/b09bb25ae0897bd64711f1b549ad3f4b.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >about 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About gameplay videos and distribution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you are free to do whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, we would appreciate it if you could introduce the game on the Steam page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who works at a newspaper company, is unable to write a good article and finds himself in a situation where there is no end in sight. Suddenly, he receives a piece of information. It was that an experiment was being conducted at a famous research institute in defiance of the law. The protagonist decides to visit the institute to take advantage of this big opportunity. However, he regrets his visit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's retrieve all the documents </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 documents scattered around the stage. Each of them contains information about the tracker, so you will have to find out the big news while gaining knowledge about the tracker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/94785d93fafb399704b81dff2d47a584.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the card key </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, the materials are located in the rooms, but some of the doors are closed. To open the doors of those rooms, you will need the card keys. Let's find the card key along with the documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/541d0fbd117ab18d8cddffa64646d933.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the tracker's pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tracker will keep chasing you. There are several safe zones in the stage, so if you are spotted, move to a safe zone immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/b09bb25ae0897bd64711f1b549ad3f4b.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach an ending, the ending will change depending on the items you have in your possession. Can you view all the endings and see the good ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/467b4dad14478d095fe875482bfbe6ea.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 3D dinosaur horror game where you have to collect multiple materials to escape while being chased by a tracker in a laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/b09bb25ae0897bd64711f1b549ad3f4b.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >about 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About gameplay videos and distribution</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically, you are free to do whatever you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, we would appreciate it if you could introduce the game on the Steam page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character, who works at a newspaper company, is unable to write a good article and finds himself in a situation where there is no end in sight. Suddenly, he receives a piece of information. It was that an experiment was being conducted at a famous research institute in defiance of the law. The protagonist decides to visit the institute to take advantage of this big opportunity. However, he regrets his visit...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's retrieve all the documents </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 8 documents scattered around the stage. Each of them contains information about the tracker, so you will have to find out the big news while gaining knowledge about the tracker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/94785d93fafb399704b81dff2d47a584.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the card key </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naturally, the materials are located in the rooms, but some of the doors are closed. To open the doors of those rooms, you will need the card keys. Let's find the card key along with the documents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/541d0fbd117ab18d8cddffa64646d933.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoid the tracker's pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tracker will keep chasing you. There are several safe zones in the stage, so if you are spotted, move to a safe zone immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/b09bb25ae0897bd64711f1b549ad3f4b.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>View multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach an ending, the ending will change depending on the items you have in your possession. Can you view all the endings and see the good ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846520/extras/467b4dad14478d095fe875482bfbe6ea.avif?t=1752856443\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The protagonist, a reporter, receives information that a laboratory is conducting experiments that defy the law. He visits the laboratory to find out what the experiment is, but regrets his decision to come... A 3D escape horror in which he explores while being chased by a tracker using only lights!",
